            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko wa Mwagazi ari hagati ahahanganye n’iyo ntebe, azobaragira, kand’ azobashōra ku masōko y’amazi y’ubugingo; kand’ Imana izohanagura amosozi yose ku maso yabo.",
          "type": "text",
